    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254030/extras/8c035a1872edcffad8837f2ac9a3a9e1.poster.avif?t=1726051539\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254030/extras/8c035a1872edcffad8837f2ac9a3a9e1.webm?t=1726051539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254030/extras/8c035a1872edcffad8837f2ac9a3a9e1.mp4?t=1726051539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Experience the life of a tribal leader from the Stone Age! Hunt, collect resources, trade, scare off wild animals, and search for treasure.<br><br><strong>Allocate resources</strong><br>Collect essential resources to clear rubble, defend against tiger attacks, and much more. Trade resources with a merchant at favorable rates and distribute responsibilities among fellow tribesmen.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254030/extras/bd54b1c58a9d00d243b98b234145b849.poster.avif?t=1726051539\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254030/extras/bd54b1c58a9d00d243b98b234145b849.webm?t=1726051539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254030/extras/bd54b1c58a9d00d243b98b234145b849.mp4?t=1726051539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Explore the area</strong><br>The game has many exciting levels of varying difficulty. Discover the world of the Stone Age, find food, and defeat enemies as quickly as possible.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254030/extras/b0a8f7b4400a2d685516d940ae21e45e.poster.avif?t=1726051539\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254030/extras/b0a8f7b4400a2d685516d940ae21e45e.webm?t=1726051539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254030/extras/b0a8f7b4400a2d685516d940ae21e45e.mp4?t=1726051539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Get rewards</strong><br>Get bonuses for completing levels quickly. Get chests, diamonds, various boosters, and many other rewards when you complete missions!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254030/extras/1a79e6a2274d17502b8a93271c449190.poster.avif?t=1726051539\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254030/extras/1a79e6a2274d17502b8a93271c449190.webm?t=1726051539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254030/extras/1a79e6a2274d17502b8a93271c449190.mp4?t=1726051539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Take care of the Dinosaur</strong><br>Feed the cute dinosaur in order to get help and survive in the Stone Age.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254030/extras/d656661bbbc0944c8e8f2b1966aeec6f.poster.avif?t=1726051539\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254030/extras/d656661bbbc0944c8e8f2b1966aeec6f.webm?t=1726051539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254030/extras/d656661bbbc0944c8e8f2b1966aeec6f.mp4?t=1726051539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
